# CoinBlink · canonical source bytes across Windows/Linux
# Prevent Context Lock raw-file SHA-256 drift caused by Windows CRLF checkout.
# Git blob SHA-1 and sha256sum must describe identical LF bytes.
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.astro text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
